WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to our intro to stores and A+ content.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
After a brand has been enrolled in and approved by Amazon Brand Registry,

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
sellers with listing privileges for the brand can begin to use

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
the full set of brand-specific tools that Amazon offers.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.053
Sellers have listing privileges for a registered brand if they're the product or rights owner who

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:22.000
enrolled the brand.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.737
Other sellers verified as internal to the brand, and resellers authorized by the brand will also

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:30.000
have listing privileges.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.950
Two of the first tools these sellers should consider using for a newly registered brand are stores

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.000
and A+ content.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Both stores and A+ content can help enhance a brand's footprint in the Amazon store.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
They also prepare those with listing privileges to use brand-specific advertising tools.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
A brand's store is a dedicated digital space within the greater Amazon store.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Brands use stores to group their product listings, highlight their value, and tell their story.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
A+ content includes enhanced images, text placements, and product comparison charts,

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.000
which brands add to their product detail pages to inform and inspire purchases.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Let's review the core features of both tools.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.222
Sellers with listing privileges can create a dedicated store for a registered brand any time by

00:01:20.222 --> 00:01:21.000
clicking stores,

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.000
then manage stores from the main menu in Seller Central.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.000
This will bring you to our stores homepage, where you can click the Create Store button to get started.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:37.000
You'll be prompted to create a brand store, which you can update as your brand or products evolve.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:44.000
During this process, you'll provide the brand name and logo, choose a template for product offerings,

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.000
and create tiles for videos, recommended products, and featured deals.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:54.857
Stores require no coding experience and can be a quick and easy way to design an immersive engaging

00:01:54.857 --> 00:01:56.000
experience for customers.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:02.955
Stores can include sub pages below your homepage, which you can use to organize and highlight a

00:02:02.955 --> 00:02:05.000
full catalog of product offerings,

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.684
help boost discovery for the brand, and make it easier for customers to compare a full range of

00:02:10.684 --> 00:02:11.000
products,

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.000
and tell the brand's story with various widgets and other features,

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.000
giving customers a centralized place to follow the brand.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:24.667
Note that after you create a store, it generally appears in the Amazon store within seven business

00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:25.000
days,

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.000
although review may take longer during peak periods.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:35.000
A+ content can also help you engage customers from the product detail pages they use to make purchases.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:42.111
Sellers with listing privileges for a registered brand can add and update A+ content anytime by

00:02:42.111 --> 00:02:43.000
clicking Advertising,

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:48.000
then A+ Content Manager in the main menu on Seller Central.

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.000
This will bring you to the A+ content homepage.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:57.000
You'll follow prompts for building enhanced product content, additional brand content, or both.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.000
You can use detailed product images, additional text placements, and product comparison charts to

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.000
provide more comprehensive descriptions of your products.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:12.476
You can also create and reuse content that tells the brand's story and builds brand awareness on

00:03:12.476 --> 00:03:14.000
each product detail page.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Like stores, A+ content requires no coding experience.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:23.895
It can be an effective way to answer customer questions, inspire purchases, and drive traffic to

00:03:23.895 --> 00:03:25.000
a brand's store.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:31.611
Note that, as with stores, new A+ content generally appears in the Amazon store within seven business

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:32.000
days,

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:36.000
although review may take longer during peak periods.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:42.000
Both stores and A+ content can help customers engage with a registered brand and its products.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.950
After you've set them up, you can start using brand-specific advertising tools to help drive customer

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.000
traffic to them.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:55.069
For example, you can use a Sponsored Brands campaign to link customers searching the Amazon store

00:03:55.069 --> 00:04:00.000
to the A+ content on product detail pages and to a brand's store.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Or you can use a sponsored display campaign to link interested customers using an app to A+ content.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:12.833
This combination of advertising and enhanced content can increase the chance that a customer will

00:04:12.833 --> 00:04:14.000
purchase a product.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:19.667
It can also increase the likelihood that they'll return to a brand when thinking about making another

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:20.000
purchase.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.500
This concludes our intro to stores and A+ content.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:27.000
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
